  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Performing by the Book? (2024), published by Leuven University Press, has no recorded citations yet, but it has been downloaded 1,404 times. Beyond that, it is used in teaching.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Performing by the Book? by Bruno Forment was published by Leuven University Press in 2024. It is part of the Orpheus Institute Series series. Conceptually, the work connects to Musical, Interpretation (philosophy), Autonomy, Process (computing) and Visual arts.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">In teaching, it is discussed in 2 recorded lectures. It has been downloaded 1,404 times via OAPEN.</p>",
